# Intent: The mouth of the Faces core comes back on the anime eyes (owner brief 2026-11-16: the thin mouth set of the approved mockup, a small dash at rest and a thin check-mark smile, looked less animated than the chunky voice-following mouth of the faces core, which the owner chose from the mouth options). Patch V10 keeps its eyes, brows, dots and shape lists; its mouth is replaced by the X01 mouth exactly: one stroke along a curve (width, bend, thickness, wobble, split) so a neutral smile, a cat mouth for happy and love, a frown, a doubting wobble and a round O ease into each other, the voice opens it into a thick soft pill (the curve flattens first), 40 ms toward open and 105 ms toward shut, a tired mouth yawns, a muted mouth is shut and calm, and the mood tint comes from the face colour as before. The stroke is now built as a shape list by the core (ml_mouth_shapes) so the unit and the settings page preview draw the same pieces; ml_mouth_target holds the scaling, mute, yawn and speaking rules in one place for both. The three styles with a mouth return to the X02 sizes (Big eyes 46 by 8, Classic 36 by 6, Minimal 22 by 3). A chunkier bowl mouth with a tongue and six named steps was drawn and compared side by side with this one on the same anime eyes (a labelled sheet and a speech strip) and looked stiffer and less alive, so it is not shipped. The pose fields of the V10 mouth (MP_MCURVE, MP_MOPEN, MP_MW, MP_MTILT, MP_MX) stay in the pose table unused by the mouth; MP_MON still hides the mouth while the thinking dots show.
# Placement: unit (the face runs on the robot, so it is complete with no host); the settings page preview draws the same shapes
# Upstream: firmware/main/hal/maipai_look_core.h (ours, patches X01, X02, V10) and firmware/main/stackchan/avatar/skins/default/mouth.cpp of the StackChan main component (MIT) as changed by X01 and V10
# Check after a flash: Big eyes neutral shows a short thick smile; happy and love show the cat mouth in their tints; speaking opens a soft pill that follows the voice and shuts smoothly between words; surprised is a round dot; the thinking dots replace the mouth; host/tests/test_face_preview_parity.py and look_core_test.c pass.

